{
  "app": "Zoom",
  "fake_bot_id": "Zoom",
  "notes": "Zoom for Slack notifications: upcoming meeting reminders and cloud-recording-ready cards. No real interactivity — 'Join Meeting' / 'View Recording' are URL buttons that open Zoom. Fits account/deal channels for customer calls. The verde_* examples tie to the SFDC 'Verde, Inc - Welo Guard - 2yr - 120k' opportunity (host Alex Lee; attendees Jack Strickland CFO, Lauren Bailey CEO).",
  "examples": [
